y is AUTO-TX-4482910. What happens now?\""], "kwargs": {}}}, "hash": "sha256:6b61621c85aacc1d0fcaa6498bb31412c1868f97abd901a399fd625476f88aac", "previous_hash": "sha256:e42f48fdf2f4f6ba5f9d586a6c9f534d4c30ed05f09c19e4b9de4b583add5810"}, {"event_type": "tool.result", "trace_id": "1c62b479435549c3", "span_id": "e26a9be95fc544c4", "parent_span_id": "f23d80fa1efa4bb3", "span_name": "mirascope:fnol_intake_agent", "sequence_id": 3, "timestamp_ns": 1784149419434915000, "payload": {"framework": "mirascope", "tool_name": "mirascope.fnol_intake_agent", "success": true, "agent_id": "fnol_intake_agent", "agent_name": "fnol_intake_agent", "latency_ms": 5982.296, "output": "['Text(type=\\'text\\', text=\\'Here\\\\\\'s the FNOL record extracted from the intake notes:\\\\n\\\\n```json\\\\n{\\\\n  \"policy_number\": \"AUTO-TX-4482910\",\\\\n  \"claimant_name\": \"Denise Okonkwo\",\\\\n  \"loss_date\": \"11th of March\",\\\\n  \"loss_type\": \"rear-end collision\",\\\\n  \"loss_location\": \"Lamar Boulevard, Austin, near the Barton Springs intersection\",\\\\n  \"insured_vehicle\": \"2021 Honda Accord\",\\\\n  \"damage_description\": \"Whole back end is crushed, trunk won\\\\\\'t shut and bumper is on the ground. Vehicle is drivable but barely.\",\\\\n  \"injuries_reported\": true,\\\\n  \"injury_description\": \"Whiplash, stiff neck and shoulder\",\\\\n  \"police_report_number\": \"APD-2025-0311-4417\",\\\\n  \"other_party_involved\": true,\\\\n  \"severity\": \"HIGH\"\\\\n}\\\\n```\\')']"}, "hash": "sha256:13dc5ab857f8a595995666cf5bae0c55992775d1719a751766370a15785e5b14", "previous_hash": "sha256:6b61621c85aacc1d0fcaa6498bb31412c1868f97abd901a399fd625476f88aac"}, {"event_type": "model.invoke", "trace_id": "1c62b479435549c3", "span_id": "8610c0a3ace2470b", "parent_span_id": "f23d80fa1efa4bb3", "span_name": "mirascope:fnol_intake_agent", "sequence_id": 4, "timestamp_ns": 1784149419434987000, "payload": {"framework": "mirascope", "model": "llama3:8b", "model_id": "ollama/llama3:8b", "